Subject: [PATCH 25/47] Unified: shorter right-click menu
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Leave out what is not needed for modelling (link actions, tree selection,
selectability, freezing, docking the window, sending to the Python
console; still in the main menus), drop stray separators, and name the
menus and items plainly (標準の視点, 重なったものから選ぶ).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
